    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b54237952f473830d2eafeaf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勝負か、いいだろう。\r\nしらけさせてくれるなよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "48dd8fcc2724768a5bd3a747cfdb209f4a98ace420545bf72f4d7f744b32dcd7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "81000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/81000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38fc51ba8cc730ad253587cf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勝ちを掴みに行く目。\r\nいいね…気に入った。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1587acb873ab11107b94e5a57399d51d65d6f13492ce684d518ed6253a603bfe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "81001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/81001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8542cccc7244cc17f368ca31",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早啊。现在也是这世间\r\n最为繁忙的时候啊……\r\n无论如何都没法习惯这般喧嚣啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c3e2296b46301381786025243b7bec2732f5e137f2b7c4708a072972197b2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad354e19e658052ac4866411",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你看上去还在犯困啊。\r\n要来场赌局让你打起精神吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "776cf69b79fd9af189ed80af17e5002bb9d642514cf89c39eaeb5f0902d9f5ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fdaad9b54cc48adcda057ad",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总觉得有点困啊……\r\n让我稍微睡会儿吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a07b4bde55e2657bd83f6e96095a8b1641b4e1cdc442d54e8fbe29f70c54bd4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf411322b1c2674a1822a683",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "肚子饿了啊……说起来，\r\n有家常去的居酒屋最近也开始\r\n卖午饭了来着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de986c667a0ef92411db7aa839f010ad932933a1938377729784b82509cd164",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0967af6b4fb9c513281decdf",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夜晚真不错啊。理性的枷锁摇摇欲坠，\r\n野心开始肆意膨胀……\r\n对追求刺激的我而言再合适不过了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a8a73881bb3f5b5192699fa775f4bfaf5e3eb864ee0bcd4aca329ef7f55e52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e55fd40f0d0f6d9f7851fa9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……有只猫一直带着一副贪婪的表情\r\n在门口瞎逛悠。\r\n真是个拿它没辙的家伙啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "454ee2c059a40891b05ed4af8fae0f9c5fb7f4ddd08fe44060c88defc33a49c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a19b141396e534fe03916e55",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天气暖和到让人犯困啊。\r\n溜出去找点儿刺激好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b25788409a3801779b0a1b46c22f45e044bc914109b04463d6bc2bdbd4c5111",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d09d83cc3c15cd7080b29705",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太阳底下热得跟火烤似的……\r\n要能顺便往我心里也添把火的话\r\n可帮大忙啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc5c0ab8a48aab5d0a2dfea9dc1b270ed06b1341fd52de6718ecede4a14c51b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46af26c13c62041249573634",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小时候老师还请过我吃烤红薯来着。\r\n……那时的寒风与地瓜的焦香味，\r\n哼，实在让人难以忘怀啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "379017ca20a6d44b9d2fa0e6ee1fbaab5c3be78f143d9f73a73b89916b433f3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78cbbab1068b75aa60db01eb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赌徒的灵魂一旦被点燃，即便是\r\n寒风也不能将之扑灭……什么的。\r\n压根就不管用啊……可恶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39b5bb1952159e693216bfac546548696c9327a134e6178dce7bcdf10109ede2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a914d26f23d67a4e21d0f4f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/90020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2aae80add07ec809daabdf3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我刚和阿船开了一局，看我俩谁能\r\n先一步在对方的帽子里藏江米条……\r\n是时候让她看看我的本事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19c7352cdaeea0537e257af54a668567faa6187d462a14c9b6bfe1330c8b0163",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
