    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fc0c56b6941993525ab5f64",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "佐敦那家伙又来找我押题了。\r\n……不过就算我给她押中了，\r\n她还是会不及格啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5861ad44203b2631c2bccb71105a33e1dfed529fbbc6ec8f84eff7ad93293c68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d9be98773f45ae9f72befb2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "闪耀是那种会在做事前\r\n事无巨细规划好一切的家伙。\r\n和我完全相反啊……也挺有趣的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f58ab71b85a92afb45f203b82074222813e61df436a0fe0bce26eab6e47186b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305148d091753b3e77433ec2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "老师又给我写信了啊……真是的。\r\n……每次都给她写回信\r\n可不是轻松活儿啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cc319407c29ac0a987f667cf41501034955fa86e8fcfdb8538964f211d33548",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93e0d77d18c287da1c9823ac",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我多少也算是会做点饭菜的。\r\n……当然啦，不可能无聊到\r\n老老实实按菜谱上写的来做就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eeb3a5b35afb495c1d0bcfb938088e526b6032e21b0b2c0cef67cbf39038bff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d49df3a281c1ff24410e6377",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "立于陶醉的中心，操弄感情的漩涡…\r\n这么想的话，LIVE倒也不赖吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4fca4bd09d6ccd44f56a9c319921f0d1b62608b1966197b19f1b89c8250a1e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62dc91662f1affe4a31ccf5c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实我没那么讨厌那种瞎热闹的气氛哦\r\n让观众彻底被热情吞没什么的，\r\n还挺有趣的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42838c522be1197474c36c6f8e537db64025ecc71098a958fcdfefb165e1c9c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15ec45ae9860073be8695800",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优雅而考究的决胜服跟我简直就是\r\n八字不合。还是这身穿起来舒服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b525f948d286197c2146ea77705c5ec1b33c435bf4853afcacff24e330e56e2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80708c25e12bc1eb710bd51d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "骰子就是对决的象征。\r\n如何？这衣服和我很搭吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6b5068a6b6648f11b22d5f412ed72128de497a951593e4fa453a0d3da9f42b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b52ca2aaf16afb5dcfb8fb3d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把那帮小鬼叫醒，给他们做饭、\r\n让他们做好上学的准备……\r\n在老家的时候，早上真是忙得要死啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "045a6d9c205f4f36afcfa2f92e4feffb60f70205e6309566ebe6126c6722263a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29de7eeccc4b916654c34b33",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……开始有点想吃东西了啊。\r\n我们两头饥肠辘辘的饿兽，\r\n要一起去更繁华的地方觅食吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c0ef7de3203f4fec9978200144e3df4ba19a799dfc3228666d79da77918fe02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e0eb4561f9a37b3ccd3b2dd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "享乐时间到了啊。\r\n……安心，我不会干出什么\r\n会给你惹麻烦的大事的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efd93a8a1e0be9ded2b6905be92c990dcd3abd888fbdcae8596f83e4fe31e1a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4a3b6bcfe0f29a673848ff6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "房间里的紫罗兰又开了啊。\r\n……不管怎么看，都只是平平无奇的\r\n普通的花罢了。真是的，为啥老师她—",
      "source_fingerprint": "609d815eceb8ff5b5dc18ca0cb33b324054fec376e954a8243786bcd840230d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:175b8c8f1c0dd39ecc91be13",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "去海边玩玩也不错啊。\r\n不过以我的性子来说，比起沙滩，\r\n我还是更喜欢在码头乱逛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c74a99efd5125fd0931e5a952279450657f42a777e806af95dafc474287af9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a71a46e5976aaf2d7c1cc0ef",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "常去的店家在叫我去吃当季的胡萝卜。\r\n嘛，毕竟一年一度的秋天嘛。\r\n你陪我一起去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e9612fad2573db7785d7d507bc46ffc2f0a2c8e9f4f9531cdb8e295d54b66d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2d601583e658a89fb8b69a2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "已经到这么冷的时候了，\r\n还是躲被炉里边吧……\r\n在桌上也玩些刺激的对局吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b15e9230c3c2561a6048e296d0a6456b0791114be8440f7ba2f33b8129b361f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/91015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73b6c8ffe4567b6ed9868cbb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好了，开干吧。\r\n在决胜负的那刻到来前，\r\n可不能让心中的火苗熄灭啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eec3b398b6ebc97f62acb5015af9badb967b489d8d103421fcbdc4d0e57ddcc8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/92000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:462e50e61d2d7d9ee9150e20",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "決める……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f251105ac4b22e6f4ee5359e1b9ebf1ec2267ed2e0efaaf1ee82cb16be2a8d87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "920000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/920000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fe6bd27dfcc495c0d066c56",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了能真正获得“已经赌上了一切”\r\n的实感，我还得努力才行啊。\r\n今天也拜托你了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc801108875e78ccc33de3c4a5f9c0bf30a3fcc7c57c6dfa2d4b596d58a0066",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/92001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0febfbe7839dcc0b7e624295",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是不做好准备的话，\r\n打从一开始便注定是场无趣的赌局。\r\n好了，打起精神开干吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bf33bf2630d3cf1407b6c0906d5415aeec6533791c906636e7c34b6a1cdb32f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/92002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6e8526ebf2d83164969d937",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身体逐渐暖和起来了，\r\n内心的火焰也开始熊熊燃烧了啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e844a8e64cdb8ed8aed23e9d34803eeff439f43203806f8ab01eade29adc13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/92003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976089124a5aab98a9c2eec2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你应该能懂我意思的吧？\r\n绝不妥协——\r\n就拜托你安排点更严苛的训练啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a57124d6940c51f8f511453849be83eecc67cd951e4f5b706349d7d458c03c91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/92005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5abe40b56203f01cca85f464",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你也沉醉于这样汗毛倒竖的感觉了吧？\r\n……我懂的，的确很爽啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d761ddaf38db5dbf79ee00076458e5ddd07e0aa85f1405a5335328f0592d3472",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/92006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c116296351283c3bf77ece88",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有人能陪我一起把那群大白痴\r\n耍得团团转的感觉也不错啊……\r\n以后就指望你了哦，搭档。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5414aec8953629477a26d5ba35793e4fe6b70c0fcf48da02866244f0e0c379b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/92007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c9516d766f136f399149b2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "脚下是阻碍前行的砂尘，头顶是\r\n蒸发体力的太阳……真是了不得的\r\n修罗场啊，我都开始感兴趣了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f306f6c6a95f950383bb79a4e2ac892563cc2934e00f882bf8b93a60769f5a89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "92011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/92011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1360589d25b475e19b702e3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咱们互相选作搭档……\r\n对彼此都是大好事啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "218599142bd2d69ce4e3279b83b9e529b3b57694bbc435f3f6daf3ab21871fca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "93000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/93000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c88293143910c23325bbed24",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这可是尽情地耍了一回蠢劲儿啊……\r\n这下可舒服啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e1d71ab4d767c4b1bce1731c59103b3b75d0b9fcd7d6b7d0b5090b00b04d8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "93001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/93001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3d75a9f22b894fb56cd6288",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这可是赛场啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cac6ac8248ae0dcbef58f146cbeeb09ef6888cb90096ee489ea55468e555547c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "95000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/95000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9363140fb8292cd4ba17646",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "走吧——\r\n朝着未曾谋面的大舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "463132294f9ae4bb11fc26a01b13734dcc2110defadf8e2f46ef886ee6d97fa6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "95001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1049/95001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dea3abb2a61815b200cbe1d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我是中山庆典。嘛，有劳你啦。",
